1
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:07,880
Greetings, Princess Consort Ling.

2
00:01:08,039 --> 00:01:09,320
How can I help you?

3
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:11,289
Is Prince Ling here?

4
00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:13,840
Prince Ling has gone hunting for a few days.

5
00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:15,960
If it's urgent, just tell me.

6
00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:20,120
I wonder if Your Highness

7
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:21,520
knows what this is.

8
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:24,160
Western Regions Ice Silkworm Silk.

9
00:01:25,080 --> 00:01:27,240
Your Highness is indeed very knowledgeable.

10
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:29,640
This kind of Ice Silkworm Silk is very rare.

11
00:01:30,320 --> 00:01:32,520
Does Your Highness have any in the mansion?

12
00:01:32,520 --> 00:01:34,320
The Ice Silkworm Silk quilts in my mansion

13
00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:35,720
are all made of this.

14
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:37,080
By the way,

15
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:38,600
there's an artisan in Fangzhou

16
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:40,720
who is exceptionally good at making this kind of Ice Silkworm Silk.

17
00:01:40,720 --> 00:01:43,160
He does it even better than the craftsmen in Chang'an.

18
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:44,360
Where is this person?

19
00:01:44,520 --> 00:01:47,320
Five miles west of the Xiguan Town gate,

20
00:01:47,720 --> 00:01:49,780
there is a silkworm breeder named Wu.

21
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:51,060
Five miles to the west.

22
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:53,800
It perfectly matches the time of death.

23
00:01:55,880 --> 00:01:57,340
Thank you, Your Highness.

24
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:05,440
Are you coming or not?

25
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:06,360
Let's go.

26
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:24,040
We've walked ten miles,

27
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:26,480
and where is the silkworm breeder?

28
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:28,880
Could Princess Consort Ling be lying to us?

29
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:29,840
I don't think

30
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:31,400
she would lie to us.

31
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:36,200
You were looking at her quite closely just now.

32
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:39,720
Did I?

33
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:43,720
When we're out investigating a case, focus on the case.

34
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:46,160
Don't always let your imagination run wild.

35
00:02:46,160 --> 00:02:46,820
I'm hungry.

36
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:48,240
There's a shop ahead,

37
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:49,850
let's get something to eat.

38
00:03:00,440 --> 00:03:01,320
Anyone here?

39
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:14,640
He says

40
00:03:14,760 --> 00:03:17,220
we should taste the yellow wine of Fangzhou.

41
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:19,880
You know sign language too?

42
00:03:19,880 --> 00:03:20,920
You know what they say,

43
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:22,850
you can never have too many skills.

44
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:25,600
Sir,

45
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:27,250
are you a silkworm breeder?

46
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:30,720
He says he runs a restaurant

47
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:32,320
and additionally

48
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:33,620
breeds silkworms.

49
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:42,040
Sir,

50
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:44,320
are the silkworms you breed

51
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:46,000
different from others?

52
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:48,960
I see they're all covered with black cloth.

53
00:03:49,880 --> 00:03:50,720
He says

54
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:53,250
his silkworms here are very precious.

55
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:55,320
They require a very low temperature

56
00:03:55,600 --> 00:03:58,720
to spin silk that is fine and cold.

57
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:00,770
Are they Ice Silkworms?

58
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:02,920
He says no.

59
00:04:03,040 --> 00:04:06,100
How could an old, lonely man like him have such ability?

60
00:04:10,160 --> 00:04:10,920
Sir,

61
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:13,160
is your surname Wu?

62
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:16,640
He says his surname is Zhang.

63
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:23,880
Is there a silkworm breeder named Wu around here?

64
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:27,760
He says if you walk a mile ahead,

65
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:30,440
there's a family named Wu.

66
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:33,640
They breed silkworms very well.

67
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:36,760
Thank you.

68
00:04:57,960 --> 00:04:58,760
Is it this person?

69
00:04:58,760 --> 00:05:00,020
We'll know when we see.

70
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:01,730
Let's go.

71
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:26,960
Xuanji Diagram.

72
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:27,840
Hong Niangzi.

73
00:05:46,520 --> 00:05:47,960
I could tell early on

74
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:51,040
that there's something wrong with you.

75
00:05:51,520 --> 00:05:53,040
A little girl's hands

76
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:54,880
actually have sword calluses.

77
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:56,520
The recent murders by Hong Niangzi,

78
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:58,080
you did them all, didn't you?

79
00:05:58,080 --> 00:06:00,400
You shouldn't speak nonsense.

80
00:06:00,760 --> 00:06:02,960
The ice silkworm thread, the Xuanji map, the corpse acupuncture,

81
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:04,320
all of these match up.

82
00:06:04,760 --> 00:06:05,640
Here

83
00:06:05,640 --> 00:06:07,200
is the primary scene where you murdered Chen Wenyuan

84
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:08,600
and Liu Rumei.

85
00:06:08,760 --> 00:06:10,640
Then you hung them on the intertwined branches.

86
00:06:10,640 --> 00:06:12,400
You used the story of Hongniangzi

87
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:14,640
to cover up the fact of your crime.

88
00:06:14,760 --> 00:06:15,280
Right?

89
00:06:15,760 --> 00:06:17,880
Since you found out,

90
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:21,320
then today,

91
00:06:21,760 --> 00:06:23,760
dead or alive, you're staying here.

92
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:27,570
Who exactly are you?

93
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:29,490
Why did you kill so many people?

94
00:06:33,400 --> 00:06:34,200
He said

95
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:35,640
he had a fetish.

96
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:39,640
One day, I fished out a female corpse in red from the river.

97
00:06:39,760 --> 00:06:41,490
It was the famous Hongniangzi.

98
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,280
I liked her corpse,

99
00:06:44,640 --> 00:06:47,300
so I used ice silkworm thread to delay the decay.

100
00:06:49,520 --> 00:06:51,200
Until one day,

101
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:53,400
A pair of star-crossed lovers

102
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:55,060
passed by here while eloping.

103
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:57,640
From their conversation, I learned

104
00:06:57,960 --> 00:07:01,020
the man was the son of Hongniangzi's unfaithful lover.

105
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:04,960
A brilliant plan came to mind.

106
00:07:04,960 --> 00:07:06,040
I drugged them,

107
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:08,960
killed Chen Wenyuan,

108
00:07:10,200 --> 00:07:11,760
raped Liu Rumei,

109
00:07:13,080 --> 00:07:14,880
and took their money.

110
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:16,600
Then,

111
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:19,560
I used the legend of Hongniangzi to cover it up.

112
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:21,280
I didn't expect

113
00:07:21,880 --> 00:07:23,680
so many people would believe it.

114
00:07:26,520 --> 00:07:27,640
This corpse,

115
00:07:28,280 --> 00:07:29,200
could it be...

116
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:37,680
He said this is Hongniangzi.

117
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:39,400
He liked her tattoo.

118
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:43,620
That you were able to trace it here

119
00:07:43,960 --> 00:07:44,760
really

120
00:07:45,080 --> 00:07:46,640
exceeds my expectations.

121
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:49,700
Since you are here,

122
00:07:50,640 --> 00:07:51,840
let Hongniangzi

123
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:56,320
kill again.

124
00:07:57,520 --> 00:07:58,159
Oh no.

125
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:11,210
What do we do, Shen Zhao?

126
00:08:11,400 --> 00:08:11,960
Whistle.

127
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:12,400
Stop joking.

128
00:08:12,400 --> 00:08:13,660
Why blow a whistle now?

129
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:15,180
Blow the whistle for help.

130
00:08:17,320 --> 00:08:18,040
Fire!

131
00:08:18,200 --> 00:08:18,800
Put it out!

132
00:08:31,200 --> 00:08:31,760
This way.

133
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:40,159
Lord Su,

134
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,539
Young Master Shen,

135
00:08:44,560 --> 00:08:45,490
are you alright?

136
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:46,480
Let's go.

137
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:47,920
Hurry up.

138
00:08:48,760 --> 00:08:49,280
Quick.

139
00:09:05,880 --> 00:09:07,520
Su Yao of our county office

140
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:09,640
is brave and intelligent.

141
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:11,640
Handling matters with perseverance,

142
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:13,760
she cracked the Hongniangzi case,

143
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:16,040
dispelling rumors for our Fangzhou.

144
00:09:16,400 --> 00:09:18,000
Her contribution is undeniable.

145
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,040
Promoted by one rank,

146
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:20,760
rewarded with a hundred taels of silver.

147
00:09:20,760 --> 00:09:22,160
Zhang Chao, Li Meng,

148
00:09:22,280 --> 00:09:23,280
rewarded equally.

149
00:09:23,280 --> 00:09:23,760
Hey,

150
00:09:24,040 --> 00:09:25,040
what about us?

151
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:28,760
Thank you, Lord Su.

152
00:09:30,280 --> 00:09:30,880
Thank you.

153
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:35,280
Cheers!

154
00:09:36,280 --> 00:09:38,920
Cheers!

155
00:09:38,920 --> 00:09:40,040
Come on.

156
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,920
From now on, we are all brothers.

157
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:42,880
Cheers!

158
00:09:43,280 --> 00:09:44,680
Come on.

159
00:09:57,800 --> 00:09:59,600
Lord Su is really busy every day.

160
00:09:59,800 --> 00:10:01,680
Still keeping a straight face at a time like this.

161
00:10:01,680 --> 00:10:03,410
I just feel something is wrong.

162
00:10:04,520 --> 00:10:05,240
Like what?

163
00:10:05,520 --> 00:10:07,120
Why did Zhang Chao and Li Meng

164
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:08,880
happen to pass by here?

165
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:11,160
Wasn't there a report?

166
00:10:12,160 --> 00:10:13,640
Then why did

167
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:16,300
the candlestick happen to light the red string?

168
00:10:17,520 --> 00:10:18,920
Go. Hurry up.

169
00:10:19,880 --> 00:10:20,400
Hurry.

170
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:29,160
Some things

171
00:10:29,640 --> 00:10:31,800
just get more complicated the more you think about them.

172
00:10:31,800 --> 00:10:34,160
We might as well just get drunk.

173
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,360
Where is Wu Shan's body?

174
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:36,490
I want to take a look.

175
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:37,640
Sister.

176
00:10:37,880 --> 00:10:40,280
You've drunk the entire yamen under the table.

177
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:41,160
What else do you want to see?
